# KEY|what it is and what the kit uses it for|where to get it|after|when
TS_NODE_karakeep|Karakeep's address on your tailnet: https://<name>.<your-tailnet>.ts.net. It must be unique in your tailnet.|||
EXPOSE_karakeep|tailnet: only your Tailscale devices can reach Karakeep, so its phone apps and browser extension need Tailscale on the device. funnel: it's reachable from the public internet (behind its own login), so they work anywhere.|||
KARAKEEP_AI|on: Ollama's model (OLLAMA_MODEL) reads each new bookmark and suggests tags, here on this Mac, so nothing leaves it. It keeps Ollama busy for a while after each one. off: no AI; tags are yours to add.|||
